            <Placemark id="3720">
                <name>The Miniatur Wunderland </name>
                <description>
                category  : See_Speicherstadt &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Kehrwieder 2  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.miniatur-wunderland.de/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The world's largest model railway layout. The panoramas include parts of Hamburg, the Alps, the American west, and a Scandinavian exhibit which features automated ships on a body of water. It also has an airport exhibit with automated planes which taxi and fly. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#110</styleUrl>
