                url  : https://www.facebook.com/ShebeenSanktPauli/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Cheap &amp; cheerful bar with minimalist decoration celebrating St.Pauli FC and other friendly clubs. It's a hangout of the St.Pauli Ultras. Outsiders very welcome, but if you don't agree with what St.Pauli stands for, this is not the place to be. After matches it can get a bit rough if the competition decides to come visit. &lt;br&gt;
