                category  : Drink_Bars &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Reeperbahn 140  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://www.zurritze.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Zur Ritze is fairly easy to find. It's near the Beatlesplatz at Reeperbahn; follow the signage down a small alley to the almost legendary door. The bar is almost always open, and it's a beautiful place to sit and talk all night. Having a nice night here won't break the bank, and it's a place to meet people who have made the Kiez the place it is today. The walls are full of photos, and in the basement there's a boxing ring where you can see local boxers training, and sometimes there are matches. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
